_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1522218005":{"text":"よそ者の貴様らには関係ない。","source_cn":"呼临城的一切都与你们无关，我没必要向你们解释。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2194B3B885EA31D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522218006:0":{"text":"好きにしろ。","source_cn":"随便你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D3433BE795982F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522218008:0":{"text":"ペルセウスは馬鹿ではない。城内の実情は、貴様らよりずっと分かってる。","source_cn":"珀尔修斯又不是傻子，呼临城内的局势他比你们这些外人更清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FEEDE6A91DD0706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522218009:1":{"text":"議事官の多くは開戦派で、領主も逆らえん。ペルセウスが迷っていなければ、とっくに総攻撃に踏み切っていた。","source_cn":"大半的议事官都主战，连领主也只能顺从。要不是珀尔修斯一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45B842CBC07C031A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522218010:1":{"text":"こういう面倒ごとを表沙汰にしていないのも、軍の士気を乱したくないだけだ。","source_cn":"这些乱七八糟的事没有抬到台面上来处理，就说明他也不希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x409B1536EF54AEA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522218011:1":{"text":"まあ、そんなところだ……分